  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion achieve high accuracy (e.g., config_039: 0.725). This experiment tests whether using pca_n2000 RNA encoder (instead of scvi_n200) with the same transformer aggregation and concat fusion (similar to config_039's setup) impacts performance. It isolates the effect of the RNA encoder, a critical design choice, while keeping other parameters consistent. This clarifies whether the RNA encoder type is a key factor, balancing exploration of important choices with exploitation of promising directions."
}

